cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Designing Perovskites For Chemical Looping Hydrogen Production"
abstract: >-
  Code for the active-learning design of high-entropy perovskite oxygen carriers for chemical-looping
  hydrogen production (CLHP): the active-learning loop, the crystal-space, SQS, relaxation and phonon
  scripts, the start set (cycle 0) of the reported runs, and the scripts and data behind the manuscript figures.
